				\begin{document}$${\text{Reltavie mRNA copy number of target gene}} = { }\frac{{\text{mRNA copy number of target gene}}}{{{\text{mRNA copy number of }}NbEF{\text{-}}1\alpha }}.$$\end{document}Reltavie mRNA copy number of target gene=mRNA copy number of target genemRNA copy number ofNbEF-1α.
